<title>FINLAND: YIT SEES 1997 EARNINGS EXCEEDING 1996.</title>
<headline>YIT SEES 1997 EARNINGS EXCEEDING 1996.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish construction group YIT-Yhtyma Oy said in a statement on Friday it expected earnings for the current year to exceed last year's. </p>
<p>&quot;YIT-Yhtyma's earnings for 1997 are expected to exceed the earnings of the previous year,&quot; YIT said in its 1996 results statement. &quot;Group turnover is expected to rise further in 1997,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>YIT's profit before extraordinary items and tax surged to 169 million markka from 13 million in 1995 as net sales rose to 5.2 billion markka from 3.9 billion.</p>
<p>The board proposed a 1.50 markka dividend, up from 0.50 markka.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 9 - 680 50 245</p>
